{"title":"Shortlist for the Astronomy Photographer of the Year 2025 Competition","link":"https://kottke.org/25/07/shortlist-for-the-astronomy-photographer-of-the-year-2025-competition","date":1752179282000,"content":"\n        <p>In looking over <a href=\"https://www.rmg.co.uk/whats-on/astronomy-photographer-year/galleries/2025-shortlist\">the shortlist for the Astronomy Photographer of the Year 2025 competition</a>, I thought about how I’ve seen thousands or even tens of thousands of incredible astronomical images and yet there are always new, mind-blowing things to see. Like this 500,000-km Solar Prominence Eruption by PengFei Chou:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1434\" alt=\"500,000-km Solar Prominence Eruption\" /></p>\n\n<p>Or Close-up of a Comet by Gerald Rhemann and Michael Jäger:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1933\" alt=\"Close-up of a Comet\" /></p>\n\n<p>Or Electric Threads of the Lightning Spaghetti Nebula by Shaoyu Zhang (Lightning Spaghetti Nebula!!!):</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"867\" alt=\"Electric Threads of the Lightning Spaghetti Nebula\" /></p>\n\n<p>Or Dragon Tree Trails by Benjamin Barakat:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/astronomer-photo-2025-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"A solitary dragon tree stands tall in the heart of Socotra’s Dragon Blood Tree forest.\" /></p>\n\n<p>Teasingly, <a href=\"https://www.rmg.co.uk/whats-on/astronomy-photographer-year/galleries/2025-shortlist\">the official site</a> only has a selection of the shortlisted entries but if you poke through the posts at <a href=\"https://www.thisiscolossal.com/2025/07/zwo-astronomy-photographer-of-the-year-2025/\">Colossal</a>, <a href=\"https://petapixel.com/2025/07/08/meet-the-30-finalists-of-astronomy-photographer-of-the-year/\">PetaPixel</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.diyphotography.net/astronomy-photographer-of-the-year-2025-shortlist/\">DIY Photography</a>, you can find some more of them. (via <a href=\"https://www.thisiscolossal.com/2025/07/zwo-astronomy-photographer-of-the-year-2025/\">colossal</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/astronomy\">astronomy</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of\">best of</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of%202025\">best of 2025</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/lists\">lists</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/science\">science</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/space\">space</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/07/shortlist-for-the-astronomy-photographer-of-the-year-2025-competition\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"336366b8667a641f8b1f65e0376ee66cec7b069c688ae89ecccec3e8127a92f4","category":"Sites"}